                    summarized in this memorandum, see <hi rendition="#italic">ante</hi>, <ref
                        target="#pg127">pp. 127</ref>–<ref target="#pg129">129</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d1205-f2" n="2" xml:id="d1205-f2-content">
                <p>For the other paragraph of this memorandum, see <ref target="#d1087">document No.
